t><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='37.6' y2='275.3' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='39.3' y='281.2' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='257.6' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='257.2' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector normal</text></g><g transform='translate(249.9,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(353.4,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>El simétrico de \\(P\\) respecto de \\(\\pi\\) es \\(P'(-2,\\ -3,\\ 7)\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: al sustituir en el primer miembro del plano, \\(P\\) da \\(6\\) y \\(P'\\) da \\(-6\\): valores opuestos, así que están a la misma distancia y a lados distintos del plano ✓.</i></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\) pasa por \\(P(2,-1,5)\\) con \\(\\vec d=(-2,3,1)\\). Como \\(\\vec d\\cdot\\vec n=-4+3-1=-2\\neq0\\), \\(r\\) corta a \\(\\pi\\). La recta simétrica pasa por el punto de corte \\(Q\\) (que es su propio simétrico) y por \\(P'\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Los puntos del plano son simétricos de sí mismos; y el simétrico de un punto de \\(r\\) está en \\(r'\\).</i>.</p><p><b>Punto de corte.</b> Sustituyo \\((2-2t,\\,-1+3t,\\,5+t)\\) en \\(\\pi\\):</p>\\[2(2-2t)+(-1+3t)-(5+t)+8=0\\iff6-2t=0\\iff t=3\\Rightarrow Q(-4,8,8)\\]<p><b>Director de </b>\\(r'\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\overrightarrow{P'Q}=(-4,8,8)-(-2,-3,7)=(-2,11,1)\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":36,\"el\":20,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-3.122,9.557,11.313],[2.572,-1.832,11.313],[0.082,-3.077,5.087],[-5.612,8.312,5.087]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[0.082,-3.077,5.087],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[2.4,-1.6,4.8],[-5.2,9.8,8.6],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[-5.2,9.8,8.6],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[-1.4,-6.3,6.7],[-4.5,10.75,8.25],\"#c2410c\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[-4.5,10.75,8.25],\"r&#39;\",\"#c2410c\",6,0],[\"line\",[2,-1,5],[-2,-3,7],\"#64748b\",1.2,true],[\"pt\",[2,-1,5],\"P\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-2,-3,7],\"P&#39;\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-4,8,8],\"Q\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 184' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m15jb4bn' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m15jb4bd' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m15jb4bg' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m15jb4br' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='281.3,31.2 49.6,18.0 58.0,108.6 289.7,121.7' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='62.0' y='108.6' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='54.9' y1='130.9' x2='307.4' y2='68.5' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x